/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Non\055linear\040theory\040of\040curved\040elastic\040sheets)
/Author (E\056\040Bromberg\054\040J\056\040J\056\040Stoker)
/Subject (1\056\040Theories\040of\040plane\040and\040curved\040shells\040which\040neglect\040bending\0561\040The\040problem\040to\040be\040treated\040here\040is\040that\040of\040determining\054\040under\040certain\040conditions\040to\040be\040stated\040later\054\040the\040stresses\040and\040strains\040in\040a\040thin\040curved\040elastic\040sheet\040in\040the\040form\040of\040a\040surface\040of\040revolution\040held\040fixed\040at\040the\040edges\040and\040subjected\040to\040a\040uniform\040pressure\040normal\040to\040the\040sheet\056\040The\040problem\040thus\040falls\040under\040the\040general\040class\040of\040problems\040treated\040in\040the\040theory\040of\040elastic\040shells\056\040In\040order\040to\040obtain\040a\040theory\040of\040elastic\040shells\040which\040is\040manageable\040from\040the\040mathematical\040point\040of\040view\054\040it\040is\040customary\040to\040make\040assumptions2\040of\040various\040kinds\054\040in\040addition\040to\040those\040of\040the\040general\040theory\040of\040elasticity\056\040These\040additional\040assumptions\040are\040usually\040based\040on\040the\040hypothesis\040that\040the\040shell\040is\040very\040thin\056\040In\040what\040follows\040we\040shall\040be\040interested\040in\040theories\040which\040result\040when\040the\040following\040assumptions\040are\040made\072\0401\051\040The\040strains\040due\040to\040the\040normal\040stress\040on\040elements\040parallel\040to\040the\040surface\040of\040the\040shell\040are\040small\040enough\040to\040be\040neglected\040safely\056\0402\051\040All\040stresses\040are\040constant\040over\040the\040thickness\040of\040the\040shell\056\040The\040first\040assumption\040is\040almost\040always\040made\040by\040writers\040on\040the\040subject\040of\040thin\040shells\056\040The\040second\040assumption\040of\040course\040rules\040out\040what\040are\040usually\040called\040bending\040stresses\056\040A\040linear\040theory\040of\040shells\054\040with\040a\040considerable\040number\040of\040practical\040applications\054\040has\040been\040worked\040out\040on\040the\040basis\040of\040the\040above\040two\040assumptions\056\040It\040is\040usually\040referred\040to\040as\040the\040membrane\040theory\040of\040shells\0563\040The\040salient\040feature\040of\040the\040theory\040is\040that\040it\040is\040\042statically\040determinate\042\040since\040the\040stresses\040can\040be\040obtained\040from\040the\040equilibrium\040conditions\040alone\040without\040reference\040to\040the\040elastic\040deformations\056\040This\040results\040in\040a\040very\040great\040simplification\054\040by\040comparison\040with\040theories\040which\040do\040not\040neglect\040bending\056\040However\054\040the\040simplification\040is\040coupled\040with\040at\040least\040one\040rather\040serious\040disadvantage\072\040it\040turns\040out\040that\040it\040is\040not\040possible\040to\040satisfy\040the\040kind\040of\040boundary\040conditions\040which\040it\040would\040be\040natural\040to\040impose\040in\040these\040problems\054\040since\040the\040order\040of\040the\040system\040of\040differential\040equations\040is\040too\040low\056\040For\040example\054\040the\040condition\040of\040a\040fixed\040edge\040\050that\040is\054\040the\040condition\040requiring\040the\040displacements\040at\040the\040boundary\040to\040vanish\051\040cannot\040be\040satisfied\040in\040general\056\040Most\040writers\040on\040the\040membrane\040theory\040of\040shells\040attribute\040the\040difficulty\040regarding)
